public sealed class TrackChoice : INotifyPropertyChanged { public int Index { get; set; } public string Label { get; set; }=""; bool selected=true; public bool Selected { get=>selected; set { if(selected==value)return; selected=value; PropertyChanged?.Invoke(this,new PropertyChangedEventArgs(nameof(Selected))); } } public event PropertyChangedEventHandler? PropertyChanged; }
public partial class MainWindow {
 HttpClient? onlineHttp,uploadHttp; MidisssCatalogProvider? catalog; MutopiaCatalogProvider? mutopia; OpennanProvider? transcription; MidiDownloadService? downloads; MidiLibraryService? library; AcquisitionWorkflow? acquisition;
 SearchDebouncer? searchDebouncer; DiscoverySearchService? discovery; SearchHistoryStore? historyStore; IReadOnlyList<string> searchHistory=Array.Empty<string>(); CancellationTokenSource? searchCancellation,onlineCancellation,preflightCancellation; int currentPage,preflightGeneration; string[] nextProviders=Array.Empty<string>(); MidiInspection? currentInspection; readonly Dictionary<string,string> knownHashes=new(); string? chosenAudio,pendingPath; LibraryEntry? pendingEntry,extractedEntry; readonly ObservableCollection<TrackChoice> trackChoices=new(); IReadOnlyList<LibraryEntry> libraryEntries=Array.Empty<LibraryEntry>(); IReadOnlyList<CatalogResult> allResults=Array.Empty<CatalogResult>(); readonly Dictionary<string,MidiInspection> inspected=new();
 void InitializeOnline() { onlineHttp=WorkflowMode?CreateWorkflowHttpClient():MidiDownloadService.CreateClient(); uploadHttp=MidiDownloadService.CreateClient(); uploadHttp.Timeout=TimeSpan.FromMinutes(5); catalog=new(onlineHttp); mutopia=new(onlineHttp); discovery=new(new Dictionary<string,IMidiCatalogProvider>{{"MIDIsss",catalog},{"Mutopia",mutopia}}); searchDebouncer=new(); historyStore=new(Path.Combine(AppDataRoot,"search-history.json")); transcription=new(uploadHttp); downloads=new(onlineHttp); library=new(Path.Combine(AppDataRoot,"Library"),importer); acquisition=new(new Dictionary<string,IMidiCatalogProvider>{{"MIDIsss",catalog},{"Mutopia",mutopia}},downloads,library,importer); TrackChoices.ItemsSource=trackChoices; Loaded+=async (_,_)=> { if(WorkflowMode) { await RunPublishedWorkflowTest(); return; } if(Environment.GetCommandLineArgs().Contains("--smoke-test"))return; try { searchHistory=await historyStore.LoadAsync(CancellationToken.None); await ReloadLibrary(CancellationToken.None); } catch(Exception ex) { LibraryStatus.Text="Local data unavailable: "+ex.Message; } }; }
 void UpdateSuggestions() { if(SearchSuggestions==null || SearchQuery==null)return; var items=SearchHistoryStore.Suggest(searchHistory,SearchQuery.Text); SearchSuggestions.ItemsSource=items; SearchSuggestions.Visibility=items.Count>0 && SearchQuery.IsKeyboardFocusWithin ? Visibility.Visible : Visibility.Collapsed; }
 void SearchFocus(object s,KeyboardFocusChangedEventArgs e)=>UpdateSuggestions();
 void SearchBlur(object s,KeyboardFocusChangedEventArgs e) => Dispatcher.BeginInvoke(()=> { if(!SearchQuery.IsKeyboardFocusWithin && !SearchSuggestions.IsKeyboardFocusWithin)SearchSuggestions.Visibility=Visibility.Collapsed; });
 void OnlineSearchChanged(object s,TextChangedEventArgs e) { if(searchDebouncer==null)return; searchCancellation?.Cancel(); searchDebouncer.Cancel(); nextProviders=Array.Empty<string>(); currentPage=0; NextPage.Visibility=Visibility.Collapsed; UpdateSuggestions(); if(!string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(SearchQuery.Text)) _=searchDebouncer.ScheduleAsync(t=>SearchOnlineAsync(0,false,t),TimeSpan.FromMilliseconds(800)); else { allResults=Array.Empty<CatalogResult>(); SearchResults.ItemsSource=null; DiscoverStatus.Text="Search to find MIDI arrangements."; } }
 void OnlineProviderChanged(object s,SelectionChangedEventArgs e) { if(searchDebouncer==null)return; searchCancellation?.Cancel(); searchDebouncer.Cancel(); nextProviders=Array.Empty<string>(); currentPage=0; NextPage.Visibility=Visibility.Collapsed; if(!string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(SearchQuery.Text)) _=searchDebouncer.ScheduleAsync(t=>SearchOnlineAsync(0,false,t),TimeSpan.FromMilliseconds(800)); }
 async void OnlineSearch(object s,RoutedEventArgs e) { searchDebouncer?.Cancel(); SearchSuggestions.Visibility=Visibility.Collapsed; await SearchOnlineAsync(0,true,CancellationToken.None); }
 async void SearchKeyDown(object s,KeyEventArgs e) { if(e.Key==Key.Escape) { SearchSuggestions.Visibility=Visibility.Collapsed; searchDebouncer?.Cancel(); searchCancellation?.Cancel(); e.Handled=true; } else if(e.Key is Key.Down or Key.Up && SearchSuggestions.Items.Count>0) { SearchSuggestions.Visibility=Visibility.Visible; var step=e.Key==Key.Down?1:-1; SearchSuggestions.SelectedIndex=Math.Clamp(SearchSuggestions.SelectedIndex+step,0,SearchSuggestions.Items.Count-1); e.Handled=true; } else if(e.Key==Key.Enter) { if(SearchSuggestions.Visibility==Visibility.Visible && SearchSuggestions.SelectedItem is string choice)SearchQuery.Text=choice; searchDebouncer?.Cancel(); SearchSuggestions.Visibility=Visibility.Collapsed; e.Handled=true; await SearchOnlineAsync(0,true,CancellationToken.None); } }
 async void SuggestionChosen(object s,MouseButtonEventArgs e) { if(SearchSuggestions.SelectedItem is not string choice)return; SearchQuery.Text=choice; searchDebouncer?.Cancel(); SearchSuggestions.Visibility=Visibility.Collapsed; await SearchOnlineAsync(0,true,CancellationToken.None); }
 async void SearchNextPage(object s,RoutedEventArgs e) { if(nextProviders.Length>0)await SearchOnlineAsync(currentPage+1,false,CancellationToken.None); }
 async Task SearchOnlineAsync(int page,bool remember,CancellationToken outer) { if(discovery==null)return; searchCancellation?.Cancel(); var request=CancellationTokenSource.CreateLinkedTokenSource(outer); searchCancellation=request; try { var query=SearchQuery.Text.Trim(); if(query.Length==0) { SearchResults.ItemsSource=null; DiscoverStatus.Text="Enter a title or artist."; return; } string[]? names=page>0 ? nextProviders : CatalogSelector.SelectedIndex switch { 1=>new[]{"MIDIsss"},2=>new[]{"Mutopia"},_=>null }; DiscoverStatus.Text="Searching providers…"; var batch=await discovery.SearchAsync(query,page,names,request.Token); request.Token.ThrowIfCancellationRequested(); var results=batch.Results.Select(r=>knownHashes.TryGetValue(r.SourceUrl,out var hash)?r with {Sha256=hash}:r); allResults=DiscoverySearchService.Merge(page==0?results:allResults.Concat(results)); currentPage=page; nextProviders=batch.Providers.Where(p=>p.Succeeded && p.HasMore).Select(p=>p.Provider).ToArray(); NextPage.Visibility=nextProviders.Length>0?Visibility.Visible:Visibility.Collapsed; ApplyDiscoverFilter(); ProviderStatus.Text=string.Join("  |  ",batch.Providers.Select(p=>$"{p.Provider}: {(p.Succeeded?"available":"error: "+p.Error)}; last success {(p.LastSuccess.HasValue?p.LastSuccess.Value.LocalDateTime.ToString("g"):"none")}")); DiscoverStatus.Text=batch.Providers.All(p=>!p.Succeeded)?"All selected providers failed; see details below.":allResults.Count==0?"No matches from the responding providers.":$"{allResults.Count} results. Select an arrangement to inspect."; if(remember && batch.Providers.Any(p=>p.Succeeded) && historyStore!=null) { searchHistory=SearchHistoryStore.Add(searchHistory,query); try { await historyStore.SaveAsync(searchHistory,request.Token); } catch(Exception ex) when(ex is IOException or UnauthorizedAccessException) { ProviderStatus.Text+=" | Search history could not be saved."; } } } catch(OperationCanceledException) { if(ReferenceEquals(searchCancellation,request))DiscoverStatus.Text="Search cancelled."; } catch(Exception ex) { if(ReferenceEquals(searchCancellation,request))DiscoverStatus.Text="Search failed: "+ex.Message; } finally { if(ReferenceEquals(searchCancellation,request))searchCancellation=null; request.Dispose(); } }
 void FilterChanged(object s,SelectionChangedEventArgs e) { if(SearchResults!=null)ApplyDiscoverFilter(); }
 void ApplyDiscoverFilter() { if(SearchResults==null || DiscoverFilter==null)return; var filter=DiscoverFilter.SelectedIndex; bool Match(CatalogResult r) => filter switch { 1=>inspected.TryGetValue(r.SourceUrl,out var item)&&item.PianoCandidate, 2=>inspected.TryGetValue(r.SourceUrl,out var item)&&item.Tracks.Count(t=>t.Notes>0)>1, 3=>!inspected.ContainsKey(r.SourceUrl), _=>true }; SearchResults.ItemsSource=allResults.Where(Match).ToArray(); if(filter>0 && DiscoverStatus!=null)DiscoverStatus.Text="Inspection filters include only analyzed files; an instrument candidate is not a verified solo arrangement."; }
 void OnlineResultSelected(object s,SelectionChangedEventArgs e) { if(SearchResults.SelectedItem is not CatalogResult r)return; onlineCancellation?.Cancel(); pendingPath=null; pendingEntry=null; currentInspection=null; trackChoices.Clear(); InspectionText.Text=""; PreflightText.Text=""; ResultDetails.Text=$"{r.Title}\nArtist: {r.Artist}\nProviders: {string.Join(", ",(r.Sources ?? new[]{new CatalogSource(r.Provider,r.Id,r.SourceUrl)}).Select(x=>x.Provider).Distinct())}\nRating: {(r.Rating?.ToString("F1") ?? "unknown")} (vote count unavailable; not a popularity measure)\n{r.Description}\nUsage: {r.License}\nAvailability: {(r.Provider=="MIDIsss" || r.DirectUrl!=null?"direct MIDI download":"open piece page in browser; no direct MIDI link")}"; }
 CancellationTokenSource BeginOnline() { onlineCancellation?.Cancel(); var cts=new CancellationTokenSource(); onlineCancellation=cts; return cts; }
 void FinishOnline(CancellationTokenSource cts) { if(ReferenceEquals(onlineCancellation,cts))onlineCancellation=null; cts.Dispose(); }
 void CancelOnline(object s,RoutedEventArgs e) { searchDebouncer?.Cancel(); searchCancellation?.Cancel(); onlineCancellation?.Cancel(); }
 async void DownloadResult(object s,RoutedEventArgs e) => await DownloadSelectedAsync();
 async Task DownloadSelectedAsync() { if(SearchResults.SelectedItem is not CatalogResult result || acquisition==null || library==null) { DiscoverStatus.Text="Select a search result first."; return; } if(result.Provider=="Mutopia" && result.DirectUrl==null) { DiscoverStatus.Text="No direct MIDI link is available; open the official source page."; return; } var cts=BeginOnline(); bool downloading=true; try { DiscoverStatus.Text="Downloading…"; var progress=new Progress<double>(p=>{if(downloading && ReferenceEquals(onlineCancellation,cts))DiscoverStatus.Text=$"Downloading {p:P0}";}); var received=await acquisition.DownloadAndInspectAsync(result,progress,cts.Token); downloading=false; knownHashes[result.SourceUrl]=received.Entry.Sha256; allResults=DiscoverySearchService.Merge(allResults.Select(r=>r.SourceUrl==result.SourceUrl?r with {Sha256=received.Entry.Sha256}:r)); await ShowInspection(received.Path,received.Entry,cts.Token,received.Inspection); if(currentInspection!=null)inspected[result.SourceUrl]=currentInspection; DiscoverStatus.Text=received.Duplicate?"Already in your library; inspect the existing copy.":"Downloaded to your library. Review tracks and warnings before import."; await ReloadLibrary(cts.Token); } catch(OperationCanceledException) { if(ReferenceEquals(onlineCancellation,cts))DiscoverStatus.Text="Download cancelled; a completed library save is retained."; } catch(Exception ex) { if(ReferenceEquals(onlineCancellation,cts))DiscoverStatus.Text="Download or validation failed: "+ex.Message; } finally { downloading=false; FinishOnline(cts); } }

 async Task ShowInspection(string path,LibraryEntry entry,CancellationToken token,MidiInspection? prepared=null) { var inspection=prepared ?? await Task.Run(()=>new MidiInspector(importer).Inspect(path),token); token.ThrowIfCancellationRequested(); SyncProfile(); var missing=profile.Missing(inspection.Song,Shift); var n=inspection.Song.Notes.Count(); var warn=(n>100000?"\nWarning: very large note count.":"")+(inspection.Tracks.Any(t=>t.NonPiano)?"\nWarning: non-piano or percussion programs detected.":"")+(missing.Length>0?$"\nUnmapped pitches ({missing.Length}): {string.Join(", ",missing.Take(30))}{(missing.Length>30?" …":"")}":""); pendingPath=path; pendingEntry=entry; currentInspection=inspection; inspected[entry.Source]=inspection; trackChoices.Clear(); foreach(var track in inspection.Tracks) { var choice=new TrackChoice{Index=track.Index,Label=track.ToString(),Selected=track.Notes>0}; choice.PropertyChanged+=(_,_)=>UpdatePreflight(); trackChoices.Add(choice); } InspectionText.Text=inspection.Summary+warn+(inspection.PianoCandidate?"\nPiano-instrument candidate based on MIDI programs and channels; solo status is not verified.":""); var sources=entry.Sources==null?$"{entry.Provider}: {entry.Source} ({entry.License})":string.Join("\n",entry.Sources.Select(x=>$"{x.Provider}: {x.SourceUrl} ({x.License ?? "license unknown"})")); ResultDetails.Text=$"{entry.Title}\nSources: {sources}\nSHA-256: {entry.Sha256}"; UpdatePreflight(); MainTabs.SelectedIndex=1; }
 async void UpdatePreflight() { var inspection=currentInspection; if(inspection==null || PreflightText==null)return; SyncProfile(); var chosen=trackChoices.Where(t=>t.Selected).Select(t=>t.Index).ToArray(); var snapshot=new KeyboardMapping { Name=profile.Name, Verified=profile.Verified, Keys=new Dictionary<int,string>(profile.Keys) }; int octave=Shift; int generation=++preflightGeneration; preflightCancellation?.Cancel(); var request=new CancellationTokenSource(); preflightCancellation=request; PreflightText.Text="Calculating compatibility…"; try { await Task.Delay(100,request.Token); var p=await Task.Run(()=>ArrangementAnalyzer.Analyze(inspection.Song,snapshot,octave,chosen),request.Token); request.Token.ThrowIfCancellationRequested(); if(generation!=preflightGeneration || !ReferenceEquals(inspection,currentInspection))return; PreflightText.Text=$"Selected notes: {p.TotalNotes}; estimated playable: {p.PlayableNotes}; excluded by track selection: {p.ExcludedNotes}\nPitch range: {p.MinPitch}–{p.MaxPitch}; maximum concurrent: {p.MaxConcurrent}; overlapping same-pitch notes: {p.OverlappingNotes}\nUnmapped pitches: {(p.UnmappedPitches.Count==0?"none":string.Join(", ",p.UnmappedPitches))}\nInvalid or conflicting mappings: {(p.InvalidPitches.Count==0?"none":string.Join(", ",p.InvalidPitches))}\nNo notes are transposed. Unselected tracks will not be imported."; } catch(OperationCanceledException) { } catch(Exception ex) { if(generation==preflightGeneration)PreflightText.Text="Compatibility check failed: "+ex.Message; } finally { if(ReferenceEquals(preflightCancellation,request))preflightCancellation=null; request.Dispose(); } }

 async void ImportOnline(object s,RoutedEventArgs e) => await ImportSelectedAsync(true);
 async Task<bool> ImportSelectedAsync(bool armPlayback) { if(pendingEntry==null||acquisition==null) { DiscoverStatus.Text="Download or inspect an entry first."; return false; } var entry=pendingEntry; var selected=trackChoices.Where(t=>t.Selected).Select(t=>t.Index).ToArray(); if(selected.Length==0) { DiscoverStatus.Text="Select at least one track."; return false; } var cts=BeginOnline(); var generation=++importGeneration; try { arm?.Cancel(); hotkeyController.SetReady(false); await engine.StopAsync(); cts.Token.ThrowIfCancellationRequested(); var prepared=await acquisition.PrepareAsync(entry,selected,cts.Token); cts.Token.ThrowIfCancellationRequested(); if(generation!=importGeneration)return false; ApplyPlayerSong(prepared.Song,prepared.Entry); MainTabs.SelectedIndex=0; if(armPlayback)Play(null!,null!); return true; } catch(OperationCanceledException) { if(ReferenceEquals(onlineCancellation,cts))DiscoverStatus.Text="Import cancelled."; return false; } catch(Exception ex) { if(ReferenceEquals(onlineCancellation,cts))DiscoverStatus.Text="Import failed: "+ex.Message; return false; } finally { FinishOnline(cts); } }

 async void RefreshLibrary(object s,RoutedEventArgs e) { try { await ReloadLibrary(CancellationToken.None); } catch(Exception ex) { LibraryStatus.Text=ex.Message; } }
 async Task ReloadLibrary(CancellationToken token) { if(library==null)return; libraryEntries=await library.ListAsync(token); var selectedHash=(PlayerSongSelector.SelectedItem as LibraryEntry)?.Sha256; PlayerSongSelector.ItemsSource=libraryEntries.OrderByDescending(e=>e.RecommendedOctave.HasValue).ThenBy(e=>e.Title).ToArray(); if(selectedHash!=null)PlayerSongSelector.SelectedItem=libraryEntries.FirstOrDefault(e=>e.Sha256==selectedHash); ApplyLibraryFilter(); }
 void LibrarySearchChanged(object s,TextChangedEventArgs e) { if(LibraryList!=null)ApplyLibraryFilter(); }
 async void LibrarySelected(object s,SelectionChangedEventArgs e) { if(LibraryList.SelectedItem is LibraryEntry entry)await LoadLibrarySelection(entry,()=>LibraryList.SelectedItem as LibraryEntry); }
 async void PlayerSongSelected(object s,SelectionChangedEventArgs e) { if(PlayerSongSelector.SelectedItem is LibraryEntry entry)await LoadLibrarySelection(entry,()=>PlayerSongSelector.SelectedItem as LibraryEntry); }
 async Task LoadLibrarySelection(LibraryEntry entry,Func<LibraryEntry?> currentSelection) { if(library==null)return; var generation=++importGeneration; hotkeyController.SetReady(false); arm?.Cancel(); try { await engine.StopAsync(); var path=await library.OpenAsync(entry,CancellationToken.None); var loaded=await Task.Run(()=>importer.Import(path)); if(generation!=importGeneration || currentSelection() is not LibraryEntry selected || selected.Sha256!=entry.Sha256)return; if(entry.RecommendedOctave is >= -2 and <= 2)Octave.SelectedIndex=entry.RecommendedOctave.Value+2; ApplyPlayerSong(Keynote.Core.PreparedSongMappings.Apply(entry.Sha256,loaded) with {Name=entry.Title},entry); LibraryStatus.Text="Selected: "+entry.Title+". Focus Roblox and press Ctrl+Alt+F8 to play."; } catch(Exception ex) { if(generation==importGeneration) { LibraryStatus.Text="Cannot load song: "+ex.Message; Status.Text=LibraryStatus.Text; } } }
 void ApplyLibraryFilter() { if(LibraryList==null || LibraryQuery==null)return; var query=LibraryQuery.Text.Trim(); var items=libraryEntries.Where(e=>e.Title.Contains(query,StringComparison.OrdinalIgnoreCase)||e.Artist.Contains(query,StringComparison.OrdinalIgnoreCase)||e.Provider.Contains(query,StringComparison.OrdinalIgnoreCase)).ToArray(); LibraryList.ItemsSource=items; LibraryStatus.Text=$"{items.Length} local entries, newest first."; }
 async void InspectLibrary(object s,RoutedEventArgs e) { if(LibraryList.SelectedItem is not LibraryEntry entry || library==null) { LibraryStatus.Text="Select an entry first."; return; } var cts=BeginOnline(); try { var path=await library.OpenAsync(entry,cts.Token); await ShowInspection(path,entry,cts.Token); DiscoverStatus.Text="Review this library entry and select tracks."; } catch(OperationCanceledException) { LibraryStatus.Text="Inspection cancelled."; } catch(Exception ex) { LibraryStatus.Text="Cannot open entry: "+ex.Message; } finally { FinishOnline(cts); } }
 async void RemoveLibrary(object s,RoutedEventArgs e) { if(LibraryList.SelectedItem is not LibraryEntry entry || library==null)return; if(MessageBox.Show($"Remove {entry.Title} from this computer?","Remove local MIDI",MessageBoxButton.YesNo,MessageBoxImage.Question)!=MessageBoxResult.Yes)return; try { await library.RemoveAsync(entry,CancellationToken.None); if(pendingEntry?.Sha256==entry.Sha256) { pendingEntry=null; pendingPath=null; trackChoices.Clear(); InspectionText.Text=""; } await ReloadLibrary(CancellationToken.None); } catch(Exception ex) { LibraryStatus.Text="Remove failed: "+ex.Message; } }
 void ChooseAudio(object s,RoutedEventArgs e) { var d=new OpenFileDialog{Filter="Audio / video|*.mp3;*.wav;*.m4a;*.ogg;*.flac;*.mp4;*.mov;*.webm"}; if(d.ShowDialog()==true) { chosenAudio=d.FileName; AudioFileName.Text=Path.GetFileName(chosenAudio); } }
 void ClearAudio(object s,RoutedEventArgs e) { chosenAudio=null; AudioFileName.Text="No file selected"; }
 async void StartExtraction(object s,RoutedEventArgs e) { if(RightsCheck.IsChecked!=true) { ExtractStatus.Text="Confirm your rights and the provider terms before submitting."; return; } if(transcription==null||downloads==null||library==null)return; var value=ExtractInput.Text.Trim(); var kind=chosenAudio!=null?"file":value.StartsWith("https://",StringComparison.OrdinalIgnoreCase)?"url":"search"; var source=kind=="file"?"User-selected file: "+Path.GetFileName(chosenAudio):value; var cts=BeginOnline(); try { ExtractProgress.Value=0; ExtractStatus.Text="Submitting to Opennan…"; var id=await transcription.SubmitAsync(kind,value,chosenAudio,cts.Token); ExtractStatus.Text=$"Job {id} submitted. Cancelling here does not cancel the remote job."; using var timeout=CancellationTokenSource.CreateLinkedTokenSource(cts.Token); timeout.CancelAfter(TimeSpan.FromMinutes(30)); var progress=new Progress<TranscriptionStatus>(current=> { if(!ReferenceEquals(onlineCancellation,cts))return; var p=current.Progress; if(p.HasValue)ExtractProgress.Value=Math.Clamp(p.Value<=1?p.Value*100:p.Value,0,100); ExtractStatus.Text=$"{current.Status}: {current.Stage}. Source: {(string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(current.Source)?"provider-selected source not supplied":current.Source)}"; }); var status=await TranscriptionJobRunner.WaitAsync(transcription,id,progress,timeout.Token);
  ExtractStatus.Text="Downloading MIDI result…"; var bytes=await downloads.DownloadAsync(transcription.DownloadUri(id),null,timeout.Token); var metadata=new CatalogResult("Opennan",id,kind=="file"?(Path.GetFileNameWithoutExtension(chosenAudio) ?? "Transcription"):value,"Unknown","Piano transcription; source and accuracy are not independently verified.","Check your rights and provider terms.",source+" | Provider-selected source: "+(string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(status.Source)?"not supplied":status.Source)); var saved=await library.AddAsync(bytes,metadata,timeout.Token); extractedEntry=saved.Entry; ExtractProgress.Value=100; ExtractStatus.Text=$"Saved {(saved.Duplicate?"existing":"new")} MIDI. Source: {(string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(status.Source)?"provider did not identify it":status.Source)}. Use Inspect result before importing."; await ReloadLibrary(timeout.Token); var resultPath=await library.OpenAsync(extractedEntry,timeout.Token); await ShowInspection(resultPath,extractedEntry,timeout.Token); DiscoverStatus.Text="Review the transcription and select tracks before importing.";
 } catch(OperationCanceledException) { ExtractStatus.Text="Local operation cancelled or timed out; the provider job may continue."; } catch(Exception ex) { ExtractStatus.Text="Conversion failed: "+ex.Message; } finally { FinishOnline(cts); } }
 async void InspectExtractResult(object s,RoutedEventArgs e) { if(extractedEntry==null||library==null) { ExtractStatus.Text="No completed result is available."; return; } var cts=BeginOnline(); try { var path=await library.OpenAsync(extractedEntry,cts.Token); await ShowInspection(path,extractedEntry,cts.Token); DiscoverStatus.Text="Review the transcription and select tracks."; } catch(OperationCanceledException) { ExtractStatus.Text="Inspection cancelled."; } catch(Exception ex) { ExtractStatus.Text=ex.Message; } finally { FinishOnline(cts); } }
 void OpenSelectedSource(object s,RoutedEventArgs e) { if(SearchResults.SelectedItem is not CatalogResult result) { DiscoverStatus.Text="Select a result first."; return; } string? url=result.Provider=="Mutopia" && long.TryParse(result.Id,out var id) && id>0 ? $"https://www.mutopiaproject.org/cgibin/piece-info.cgi?id={id}" : result.Provider=="MIDIsss" ? "https://midisss.com/" : null; if(url!=null)try { Process.Start(new ProcessStartInfo(url){UseShellExecute=true}); } catch(Exception ex) { DiscoverStatus.Text="Could not open website: "+ex.Message; } }
 void OpenProvider(object s,RoutedEventArgs e) { var key=(s as Button)?.Tag as string; var url=key switch { "mutopia"=>"https://www.mutopiaproject.org/", "bitmidi"=>"https://bitmidi.com/", "collection"=>"https://midicollection.com/", "terms"=>"https://opennan.com/legal/terms", _=>null }; if(url!=null)try { Process.Start(new ProcessStartInfo(url){UseShellExecute=true}); } catch(Exception ex) { DiscoverStatus.Text="Could not open website: "+ex.Message; } }
 void DisposeOnline() { remappedCancellation?.Cancel(); preflightCancellation?.Cancel(); searchDebouncer?.Cancel(); searchCancellation?.Cancel(); onlineCancellation?.Cancel(); onlineHttp?.Dispose(); uploadHttp?.Dispose(); }
